     <\/tr>\n      <\/tbody>\n    <\/table>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- M\u00f3dulo de Links & Acesso R\u00e1pido -->\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n    <div style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 0.88rem;\">\n      \ud83d\udd0d Consulta os p\u00f3dios, tempos individuais e ferramentas de ritmo:\n    <\/div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/resultados-corrida-volkswagen-autoeuropa-2026\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6D28D9 0%, #5B21B6 100%); color: #FFF; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);\">\n        \u26a1 P\u00f3dios &amp; Estat\u00edsticas Completas \u2197\n      <\/a>\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/run.volkswagenautoeuropa.pt\/pt.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); color: #C4B5FD; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none;\">\n        Classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial \u2197\n      <\/a>\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora-de-ritmos-de-corrida\/\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); color: #94A3B8; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none;\">\n        Calculadora de Paces\n      <\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO DE RESULTADOS E ESTAT\u00cdSTICAS -->\n<!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026<\/strong> (tamb\u00e9m designada como <strong>Volkswagen Run<\/strong>) realiza-se no dia <strong>25 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), em <strong>Palmela<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o abre as portas de uma das maiores f\u00e1bricas de autom\u00f3veis da Europa a milhares de corredores e fam\u00edlias, oferecendo uma experi\u00eancia desportiva e tecnol\u00f3gica \u00fanica com partidas e chegadas nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es centrais da <strong>Volkswagen Autoeuropa<\/strong> na Quinta da Marquesa.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes optar pela <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico no interior da f\u00e1brica e parque industrial adjacente (partida \u00e0s 10:00), pela <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> para todas as idades (partida \u00e0s 10:20) ou pelas corridas infantis da <strong>Mini Kids<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:00 com dist\u00e2ncias dos 300m aos 1000m para Bambis, Benjamins e Infantis). O evento inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial unissexo, dorsal personalizado, medalha de finalista, abastecimentos e estacionamento gratuito no complexo industrial.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 <strong>Volkswagen Autoeuropa<\/strong> com a coordena\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e operacional da <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong>, garantindo percursos planos em asfalto com seguran\u00e7a integral e cronometragem oficial via Lap2Go.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tec